<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/93401ADSVCQMQNMJNHNNNRLDRJPDKQRCG> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "FAMILY CONCERT: Wall to Wall Percussion";
  schema:description """
	Percussion superstar Vern Griffiths welcomes the audience into “his house” for a wildly fun, hands‑on percussion adventure. With creativity to spare, and yes, everything including the kitchen sink, using pots & pans, wooden spoons and glass bottles, Vern whips up a kitchen concerto, showing how anyone can make and play instruments at home. The show is interactive, imaginative, and an absolute blast!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Enjoy <span class=\"BoldText\">both VIS Family Series shows</span> this season and save!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">2-Show Package:</span> Pay What You Can <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Family Concert Series #1: Wall to Wall Percussion<span><br/></span>Saturday, Nov. 7, 2026<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Family Concert Series #2:  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.porttheatre.com/events/family-concert-series-what-do-you-play-2027/\">What Do YOU Play?</a><span><br/></span>Sunday, Feb. 21, 2027
""";
