<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/98401ANRTQBTMRLQLKVRCHBLJPDMMRSCK> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Festive Brass presents A Cinematic Christmas";
  schema:description """
	The movies you love. The music of Christmas.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>More than a traditional holiday concert, A Cinematic Christmas combines spectacular live brass, vocals, storytelling and theatrical surprises in a fast-moving show for audiences of all ages. Familiar favourites meet unexpected musical twists, with plenty of warmth, humour and Christmas spirit along the way.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Festive Brass is joined by acclaimed singer and storyteller Joëlle Rabu, along with the Malaspina Choir and the Nanaimo Youth Choir, for an afternoon inspired by the music and moments of Home Alone, Elf, The Polar Express, A Charlie Brown Christmas, How the Grinch Stole Christmas, James Bond and more.
""";
