<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/98201APGBTHJSQKRVSCNKTBQBGVMNPQHT> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Ghosts, Ghosts, Ghosts";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets available for sale at the door only. Cash only</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Opera Nanaimo presents a fascinating evening music for Halloween!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span> Three outstanding soloists will present music from Art song and opera that is will thrill and delight you.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span> Also included is an original new horror opera by Roan Shankaruk, called U-29.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span> It was commissioned and premiered by Vancouver’s Opera Unbound and chronicles the mysterious final days of a WW1 U-boat and the crew who manned her. Not to be missed!  
""";
