<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/93001AKPMKDQLDNTLBKNJTSQGLTNBGGRP> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Girls Night Out The Show (19+ Only)";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Girls Night Out The Show®</span> — Wild Nights 2026 Tour — is taking over the stage live at the Port Theatre!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This high-energy, all-male dance revue will have you on the edge of your seat from start to finish with heart-pumping music, chiseled bodies, seductive routines, cheeky humor, and boy-next-door charm.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This isn’t the kind of show where you just sit and watch!  <span class=\"BoldText\">Girls Night Out The Show®</span> is a fully interactive, immersive experience thundering with excitement. Get ready to get a little wild in an empowering, fun-filled atmosphere and embark on an unforgettable night with your friends.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets sell fast — don’t wait! Get yours today!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1 VIP Seating</span> Includes a Meet 'N Greet and photo with the cast before the show at 6:30PM!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This event is 19+ only.
""";
