ano-and-vocal performance of \"What Are You Doing New Year's Eve?\", a lush, emotional delivery of \"Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\", and a stirring rendition of  the timeless \"The Christmas Song\".  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This isn't just a concert—it is a cozy, nostalgic time capsule. It captures the exact qualities that made Ella Fitzgerald a global treasure: her flawless purity of tone, her impeccable timing, and above all, the genuine warmth and humility she shared with every audience. Perfect for jazz lovers and holiday dreamers alike, Home for the Holiday's ~ An Ella Fitzgerald Christmas is the ultimate way to ring in the season with style, soul, and a whole lot of holiday joy. ​ <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We welcome you to join us this December for an unforgettable holiday event not to be missed as we celebrate the music, stories, traditions, and many joyful moments created at this very special time of year. 
""";
