<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/96001ATDVLRTKLJNHLNKQRGVCMQBHMDTV> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Let's Go Surfin'!";
  schema:description """
	Hailed as the best Beach Boys tribute on the planet, BACKBEAT’s Let’s Go Surfin’! theatre show has dazzled audiences everywhere with its mind-blowing harmonies and top tier musicianship.  Hit after hit—you don’t just hear this incredible music.  You FEEL it.  A wave of nostalgia will crash over you, and sweep you away to a time of sun, sand, and surf in the most Fun Fun Fun evening you can imagine!<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>The stage explodes with sound, lighting, video and musical energy — a dazzling ocean of lit-up surfboards, glowing and pulsing in rhythm with the music, framing the band in a kaleidoscope of light and imagery.  Each song builds the wave higher — a breathtaking journey through one of the most iconic soundtracks in pop music history!<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Whether you grew up on the music of the Beach Boys, or just discovered it, this show will lift you up, spin you around, and send you home humming with happiness.  BACKBEAT’s Let’s Go Surfin’! is more than a tribute — it’s a love letter to the sound that defined a generation and still inspires millions.  Grab your shades, your smile, and your sense of adventure — because when BACKBEAT hits the stage, the surf’s up, the lights and video are dazzling, and every night feels like summer in California.<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>“it was mind-blowing”<span><br/></span>“just… unbelievable”<span><br/></span>‘the best tribute band I’ve ever seen”<span><br/></span>“pure magic.  Solid fun.  Five stars” <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Don’t miss the remarkable Beach Boys tribute: Let’s Go Surfin’!<span><br/></span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-11-16T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
