<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/71002ASCMCKCBKSBHNNMMJSTMKNRGTRVT> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "NANAIMO CONCERT BAND Fall Concert";
  schema:description """
	Get ready for takeoff with Music Director Scott MacInnes and the Nanaimo Concert Band as they present Flying High, an uplifting musical journey filled with soaring melodies dedicated to the magic of the skies and the pure thrill of aviation.<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Your feet won't touch the ground during a fun concert featuring everything from stirring marches to music from \"How to Train Your Dragon\" and \"Superman\" !  <span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Get out of the house and spend a Sunday afternoon at Nanaimo's incredible Port Theatre at a performance that all generations can enjoy together at an extremely affordable price!<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Nanaimo Concert Band believes that there is nothing better than live music shared with an audience.  Music is powerful, and live music is the best antidote to screen time!<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>So, fasten your seatbelts, return your seats back to the upright position and prepare for takeoff!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://nanaimoconcertband.com/announcement/\"> Nanaimo Concert Band Announcements</a>
""";
