  schema:description """
	Pacific Contact is BC’s annual performing arts showcase conference. Pacific Contact 2026 will be held on Vancouver Island for the first time in their 50 year history. They are proud to partner with The Port Theatre, Tourism Nanaimo and the City of Nanaimo to present the conference on the territory of the Snuneymuxw First Nation.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The conference will welcome hundreds of presenters, artists and agents for four packed days featuring 40+ multidisciplinary performances including Main Stage and Pitch & Perform Showcases. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">1:30pm - 2:00pm</span><span><br/></span>Hosted by Nayana Fielkov<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://littleonionpuppetco.weebly.com/\">Little Onion Puppet Co. - Otosan</a><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://la-nef.com/\">La Nef - Undersea</a><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.ndidicascade.ca\">ORIGINZ</a>
""";
