<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/98801AKQTBNPHKSKVKNHDSDLMDTQTRVHK> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Port Theatre Annual General Meeting";
  schema:description """
	Everyone is welcome! Members and non-members.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Why join us?<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Attending our AGM demonstrates your appreciation of The Port Theatre Society’s mandate to:<span><br/></span>•	Build and serve our community by bringing people together as a vital gathering place.<span><br/></span>•	Deliver exceptional performance experiences for artists and audiences.<span><br/></span>•	Act as a catalyst in the creation, collaboration, and development of transformative new works and talent.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>At our AGM<span><br/></span>•	Learn about our successes (from the reporting period of July 2025 to June 2026)<span><br/></span>•	Hear from our Artistic Executive Director, David Warburton<span><br/></span>•	Get an update from our Board of Directors<span><br/></span>•	Receive a copy of the Annual Report and our audited financial statements<span><br/></span>•	Honour our Volunteer Award recipient <span><br/></span>•	Enjoy light refreshments and entertainment.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Check your <span class=\"BoldText\">Port Theatre account online</span> to see if your membership is current.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please pre-register by email: admin@porttheatre.com
""";
