<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/99401APPDJPTMCNDVGNBQJKKGBJNTJSJR> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Snowed In Comedy Tour";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">The Snowed In Comedy Tour is back - with a brand new show! The tour where you never hear the same jokes again.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>What started 18 years ago as a wild idea in the middle of a Canadian winter has snowballed into a national comedy phenomenon. Today, the Snowed In Comedy Tour is Canada's biggest comedy tour, bringing some of the country's best stand-up comedians to audiences from coast to coast.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For 18 years, Snowed In has built its reputation the old-fashioned way: great comedians, packed theatres, and an unforgettable night of live stand-up. The tour has grown into a Canadian success story, proving year after year that world-class comedy doesn't just belong in the big cities - it belongs everywhere.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">THIS YEAR'S LINEUP IS STACKED</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Dan Quinn</span> - Snowed In Comedy Tour founder and winner of the Canadian Comedy Competition at Just for Laughs. Dan has opened for comedy heavyweights including Russell Peters and Rob Schneider and has performed at major festivals across Canada.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Paul Myrehaug</span> - Winner of the $25,000 Great Canadian Laugh Off, Paul has performed at Just for Laughs, appeared on CBC's The Debaters and Comedy Now, and built an international comedy career performing around the world.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Pete Zedlacher</span> - One of Canada's most accomplished stand-up comedians, Pete is a 6-time Canadian Comedy Award nominee for Best Male Stand-Up, winner of SiriusXM's Top Comic, and an 8-time performer at Montreal's Just for Laughs.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Erica Sigurdson</span> - A Canadian comedy favourite with more than 80 appearances on CBC's The Debaters. Erica has performed at Just for Laughs, the Winnipeg Comedy Festival and the Halifax Comedy Festival, earning a reputation as one of the sharpest and funniest voices in Canadian comedy.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Together, they bring four completely different comedic styles to one stage for a fast-paced show packed with laughs from beginning to end.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Four international comedians. One stage. Eighteen years of laughs. Critics have called the Snowed In Comedy Tour “Better than the Just for Laughs Tour” and “A Flurry of Laughs You Can't Miss.” After 18 years, the Snowed In Comedy Tour is still growing, still touring, and still proving why it has become Canada's biggest comedy tour.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Don't just get through winter - laugh your way through it with the Snowed In Comedy Tour.
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-01-21T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/files/bf29b08a-5573-4269-a5d6-5acbe2452cb1.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/theporttheatre/location/407AGBMNMGJMSNPVKJMSNVLRPHJBTDPHT>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/theporttheatre/organization/dan-quinn-entertainment>;
