<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/100001AMKHKQSKSCRQTDTNDGDHBLHMNPK> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "THE SHEEPDOGS";
  schema:description """
	The Sheepdogs are Canada's leaders in rock 'n' roll entertainment. Four-time JUNO Award winners from Saskatoon, with multiple Gold and Platinum records to their name, they blend soaring harmonies, dual-guitar wizardry, and a stage presence that turns audiences into true believers.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Sheepdogs deliver the real goods: rock music that's loud, loose, and full of soul. They've taken their unmistakable sound from bars and roadhouses to festival stages around the world, earning a reputation as one of the most electrifying live bands on the road today. Night after night, they remind audiences that rock 'n' roll isn't something to look back on. It's alive, well, and thriving.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Across 14 releases, including their latest album Keep Out Of The Storm, The Sheepdogs have built one of the most respected catalogues in modern rock. With their own label, Right On Records, they're firmly in control of their future, continuing to write the next chapter on their own terms. Their reputation has long been established, but every new record and every night on stage proves the same thing: rock 'n' roll is alive and well, and The Sheepdogs are leading the charge.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>VIP Add-On Experiences available! </h2><span class=\"BoldText\">(One add-on required per ticket purchased)</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Want to hang with The Sheepdogs before the show? Upgrade your concert ticket with an additional VIP Add-On package for a group Q&A, a stripped-back acoustic song, and the Wild Card Hang.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The band travels with a full-size game show wheel that Gold VIP guests spin to choose surprise activities. The band might write a song about a guest, draw a portrait, or the wheel might send things in another direction entirely. Silver guests join the group experience and shared activities.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Both packages include a signed, limited-edition Keep Out Of The Storm LP, an exclusive live 10\" vinyl record that is Exclusively available to VIP attendees, and not sold in stores, a VIP laminate and lanyard, early merchandise shopping, and priority entry. Gold also includes individual time with the band, a Polaroid photo, and selfies.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>After purchase, the VIP coordinator will be in touch to coordinate logistics.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Add-on #1 GOLD VIP: $131.25 CAD per person</span></span><span><br/></span>•	Q&A + Wild Card Hang: spin the full-size game show wheel to unlock a surprise activity. <span class=\"BoldText\">Only Gold guests</span> spin the wheel<span><br/></span>•	One-on-one time with the band, including an individual Polaroid photo and selfies<span><br/></span>•	Exclusive merchandise: a signed, limited-edition Keep Out Of The Storm LP and an exclusive live 10\" vinyl record (Exclusively available to VIP attendees, not sold in stores)<span><br/></span>•	One VIP laminate and lanyard<span><br/></span>•	Pre-show merchandise shopping before the venue opens to the public<span><br/></span>•	Priority entry into the venue<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Add-on #2 SILVER VIP: $78.75 CAD per person</span></span><span><br/></span>•	Q&A + Wild Card Hang: attend the group experience and shared activities as Gold guests spin the wheel<span><br/></span>•	Exclusive merchandise: a signed, limited-edition Keep Out Of The Storm LP and an exclusive live 10\" vinyl record (Exclusively available to VIP attendees, not sold in stores)<span><br/></span>•	One VIP laminate and lanyard<span><br/></span>•	Pre-show merchandise shopping before the venue opens to the public<span><br/></span>•	Priority entry into the venue<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>
""";
