<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/91001AGRQVVNCNSQHCNHSNGBSKJVCSJCL> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Shoop Shoop Show";
  schema:description """
	Get ready to experience a Cher show like no other – returning to Canada in 2027!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>‘Turn Back Time’ with The Shoop Shoop Show - The Cher Collection, an exhilarating music-led production with a party atmosphere. It is led by international powerhouse vocalist Rachael Hawnt, the winner of ITV’s Starstruck.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The show spans every decade of Cher’s incredible career so be prepared to be dazzled by disco HITS and pop rock chart-toppers. As the show unfolds Rachael’s spot-on impersonation will make you ‘Believe’.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>As if that wasn’t enough, the singing sensation performs songs from Cher’s iconic ‘Dancing Queen’ album, belting out unforgettable sing-along renditions of ABBA's greatest hits.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>‘Dressed to Kill’ with incredible custom-made costumes, jaw-dropping production, choreography and a world class live band, The Shoop Shoop Show - The Cher Collection will have you singing and dancing the night away.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>So, glam up, grab a ticket, and come and experience the magic of one of the greatest Divas of all time!
""";
