  schema:name "Voices In The Vineyard at Nanoose Bay Cafe - Tickets Available at the door";
  schema:description """
	<span class=\"BoldText\">Tickets will be available at the door, Cash only - those who purchase tickets at the door must bring their own lawn chair</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Opera Nanaimo again presents its summer Voices in the Vineyard concert at the Nanoose Bay Cafe! <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Four outstanding soloists will sing some of your favourite selections from opera and musical theatre on the outdoor patio. Guaranteed to be a delightful afternoon of music! Get your tickets early since this event has sold out in the past.
""";
