<http://www.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/event/92004APSNBGNSPNKRQNCCLMDGMQJGGLRC> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Yellowpoint Christmas Spectacular";
  schema:description """
	The <span class=\"BoldText\">Yellowpoint Christmas Spectacular</span> is back at the Port Theatre!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This beloved West Coast holiday tradition lights up Vancouver Island with music, dance, laughter, and holiday magic every December. For nearly two decades, audiences from Courtenay to Nanaimo to Victoria have made Yellowpoint part of their holiday celebrations.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For the past 18 years, Artistic Director and Creator <span class=\"BoldText\">Katy Bowen-Roberts</span> has crafted a brand-new edition of the Yellowpoint Christmas Spectacular each holiday season. She skillfully weaves together beloved musical tributes, heartwarming stories and readings, dazzling choreography, stunning costumes, festive lights and décor, and exceptional performances to create a magical celebration of the season.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Each year features an all-new production, with choreography by <span class=\"BoldText\">Lindsay Sterk</span> and musical arrangements by <span class=\"BoldText\">James Mark</span>, ensuring every performance sparkles with fresh surprises, cherished traditions, and holiday cheer.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Get ready for another unforgettable musical journey! This year's singing and dancing extravaganza features everything from <span class=\"ItalicText\">The Beatles</span> classics and show-stopping numbers from <span class=\"ItalicText\">Annie</span> to the iconic sounds of <span class=\"ItalicText\">Hall & Oates</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Fleetwood Mac</span>. Add in spirited Celtic fiddle tunes, timeless jazz standards made famous by <span class=\"ItalicText\">Ella Fitzgerald</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Louis Armstrong</span>, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Bing Crosby</span>'s beloved <span class=\"ItalicText\">White Christmas</span>, and a host of holiday favourites, and you have a show guaranteed to leave you humming, singing, and smiling all the way home.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>More than a concert, the Yellowpoint Christmas Spectacular is a celebration of community.  A chance to gather with family and friends, share in the joy of the season, and create lasting holiday memories together.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us this holiday season and experience the magic that keeps audiences coming back year after year.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\"><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Creative Team</span></span><span><br/></span>Creator & Artistic Director: Katy Bowen-Roberts<span><br/></span>Music Director & Arranger: James Mark<span><br/></span>Director & Choreographer: Lindsay Sterk<span><br/></span>Lighting Designer: Hilary Britton-Foster<span><br/></span>Sound Designer: Liam Worthington<span><br/></span>Stage Manager: Shelby Matthews<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h1>Special VIP Event</h1>Join us for our VIP Experience following the evening performance on Friday, December 18. Meet the cast, enjoy a complimentary drink and taste a selection of cheeses, experience a short exclusive musical performance, and celebrate the season with fellow Yellowpoint fans. Please note this is an <span class=\"BoldText\">add-on</span> and must be purchased in addition to each YPCS ticket<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.yellowpointchristmasspectacular.ca\">their website</a> for more info about the show.
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-12-18T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/theporttheatre/files/9f5896d3-dbec-47e0-bba7-f92f59359f76.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/theporttheatre/location/407AGBMNMGJMSNPVKJMSNVLRPHJBTDPHT>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/theporttheatre/organization/razzle-dazzle-productions>;
